  <div class="hd-human"><article class="card listing offer" >
  <div class="human-face">
    <header>
      <span class="chip kind-offer">Offering</span>
      <span class="cat"><i class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8.5 7-5 5 5 5M15.5 7l5 5-5 5M13.5 4.5l-3 15"/></svg></i><span>Development</span></span>
      
      
      
    </header>
    <h3 ><a href="/en/l/129-update-website-prices-photos-and-texts">Update website: prices, photos and texts</a></h3>
    <p class="excerpt">I will help update an existing website: replace photos, fix texts, update the price list and contact information. First, I will look at the site and…</p>
    
    <footer>
      <div class="pricerow"><strong class="price mono">from RUB 1,500</strong><small class="approx mono" title="At today’s exchange rate, for comparison. The author set the price in their own currency.">from ≈ $19</small></div>
      <div class="meta"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg>done in 3 days</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5.5h9M8.5 4v1.5c0 4-2 7-4.5 8.5M6 9.5c1.2 2 3 3.5 5 4.3"/><path d="m12.5 20 3.8-9 3.7 9M13.8 17h5"/></svg>RU</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M3.5 12h17M12 3.5c2.4 2.6 3.5 5.5 3.5 8.5s-1.1 5.9-3.5 8.5c-2.4-2.6-3.5-5.5-3.5-8.5s1.1-5.9 3.5-8.5z"/></svg>Moscow, UTC+3</span></div>
    </footer>
